{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And you shall make.</b> The mishkan is not only the curtains and the planks, and when He made known the mishkan, so too the planks." "<b>And the word עֹמְדִים [standing].</b> According to the nature of the wood, for the length is the height, and thus a person when he is standing, and the opposite of this when lying down. Or the word עֹמְדִים refers to upright angles."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:35.651203939Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}